# Append-only generated or row files: a merge keeps both sides' lines
# (builtin union driver, no git config needed). A stale result fails the
# icon and snapshot tests in CI. A union merge can resurrect a deleted row:
# mergeRows (scripts/assets/merge-rows.mjs) and eslint no-dupe-keys catch it;
# the fix is to delete the stand-in row. See CONTRIBUTING.md, "Generated files".
packages/game-core/src/skills/__snapshots__/roles.test.ts.snap merge=union
scripts/assets/skill-icons/*.mjs merge=union
